# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for Gemini AI API calls.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets.
GEMINI_API_KEY="MY_GEMINI_API_KEY"

# APP_URL: The URL where this applet is hosted.
# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.
APP_URL="MY_APP_URL"

# ==============================================================================
# GOOGLE SHEETS PRIMARY DATABASE CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================
# The application uses Google Sheets API to store and sync all school records across
# 10 separate worksheets:
# 1. Students (Permanent Student ID, Admission, Roll, Class, Bio)
# 2. Classes and Sections
# 3. Subjects
# 4. Examinations
# 5. Examination Subjects (Max Marks & Pass Marks)
# 6. Marks (Cell-by-cell marks and Absent indicators)
# 7. Marks History (Immutable audit trail of all score edits)
# 8. Calculation Settings (Custom percentage formulas, weights, ranking)
# 9. Report Card Settings (Aptos layout, signatures, grading scale)
# 10. Application Settings (School name, affiliation, sessions)
#
# Client Mode (Default):
# Users authenticate directly via Google Sign-In with Google Sheets OAuth scopes:
# - https://www.googleapis.com/auth/spreadsheets
# - https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive.file
#
# Server-Side Headless Service Account Mode (Optional):
# For automated background sync without interactive sign-in, specify:
GOOGLE_SHEET_ID=""
GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_EMAIL=""
GOOGLE_PRIVATE_KEY=""
